  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfa97c1be94e1916",
      "translationZh": "我们正在发布 Qwen3.8-27B 的全量化 NVFP4 版本。该检查点通过我们的新 QAT 算法 QUASAR，采用量化感知蒸馏（QAD）训练而成。我们以原始 BF16 模型作为教师模型，对量化模型进行了 2,446 步蒸馏。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "168c029836a3c585",
      "translationZh": "该检查点支持在 NVIDIA Blackwell GPU 上使用 vLLM：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c122beb42afbc970",
      "translationZh": "该模型采用激进的量化配置：所有 transformer 块中的每个线性层都被量化为 NVFP4（W4A4）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb95eeb22f45f8f2",
      "translationZh": "注意力层和 GDN 层通常保持较高精度，例如 FP8 或 BF16，因为对它们进行量化可能导致模型质量显著下降。不过，借助 QUASAR，全量化检查点仍保有接近 BF16 的性能。评估结果及与其他 NVFP4 检查点的对比如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "929a3f004bde13a0",
      "translationZh": "模型 大小 GPQA-Diamond（2 次运行，n=396） AIME26（3 次重复，n=90）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49be61e7d366d7af",
      "translationZh": "Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B（原始 BF16）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3e5b5c97ec9720c",
      "translationZh": "论文：https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.13966v1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1e4a560ff77a8fb",
      "translationZh": "我们很想听听你对这个模型检查点的反馈！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
